@@ -105,3 +105,14 @@ knife ssh 'hostname:fizzy-lb-*' 'sudo docker exec fizzy-load-balancer kamal-prox
 ## License
 
 fizzy-saas is released under the [O'Saasy License](LICENSE.md).
+
+## Billing
+
+Create two monthly recurring Stripe prices: Unlimited ($20/month, 5 GB) and
+Unlimited+ ($25/month, 500 GB). Set `STRIPE_UNLIMITED_PRICE_ID` and
+`STRIPE_UNLIMITED_PLUS_PRICE_ID` to their price IDs, and configure
+`STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` and `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. Point Stripe's signed webhook
+endpoint at `/stripe/webhooks` and enable `checkout.session.completed` and
+`customer.subscription.created`, `.updated`, and `.deleted`. Checkout and the
+billing portal are hosted by Stripe; customer portal configuration must be
+created in the Stripe dashboard. Without the price IDs checkout is unavailable.
